      "error_message": "23503 FK violation fk_refresh_tokens_refresh_tokens_replaced_by_token_id on POST /api/auth/refresh",
      "file": "backend/src/Kahoot.Application/Authentication/Refresh/RefreshTokenCommandHandler.cs",
      "root_cause": "Race-safe rewrite used ExecuteUpdateAsync to set replaced_by_token_id = rotated.Id BEFORE the rotated token row was inserted; ExecuteUpdate runs immediately so the self-FK pointed at a non-existent row.",
      "fix": "Insert the rotated token first (SaveChanges), THEN run the atomic guarded ExecuteUpdate on the old token (WHERE RevokedAt IS NULL) setting RevokedAt + ReplacedByTokenId; if 0 rows (lost the rotation race) revoke the orphan rotated token and return InvalidRefreshToken.",
